   "when": "2026-09-04 19:38",
   "sent": "positive",
   "txt": "**1. Single Most Important Fact**\nMazagon Dock Shipbuilders Limited (MDL) has secured a domestic purchase order valued at \u20b9117,99,71,564.90 (~\u20b9118.00 crore, inclusive of 18% GST and other duties) from Maharashtra State Electricity Transmission Co. Ltd. (MSETCL).\n\n---\n\n**2. Key Numbers Exactly as Stated**\n* **Order Value:** INR 117,99,71,564.90 (Rupees One Hundred and Seventeen Crore Ninety Nine Lakh Seventy One Thousand Five Hundred and Sixty Four and Paise Ninety Only) inclusive of GST @ 18% and other duties.\n* **Scope/Scale:** 05 Substations (AI-based Comprehensive Infrasecure Project).\n* **Execution Period:** 24 months.\n* *(Note: Financial metrics such as revenue, EBITDA, and PAT deltas are not applicable/not included in this order-intimation filing).*\n\n---\n\n**3. Management Guidance / Outlook**\n* None stated in the filing beyond the stipulated project completion timeline of **24 months**.\n\n---\n\n**4. What a Shareholder Should Watch or Act On**\n* **Execution & Revenue Recognition:** Monitor execution milestones across the 24-month schedule.\n* **Segment Diversification:** Watch for further order inflows in non-shipbuilding/AI-based infrastructure security contracts, expanding beyond core defense/marine platforms.\n\n---\n\n**5. One-Line Net Read**\n* **Positive**: Incrementally adds ~\u20b9118 crore to MDL's order book and demonstrates commercial diversification into AI-based infrastructure, though modest in scale relative to its core defense shipbuilding backlog."
  },
